# INTENTIONALLY INSECURE SYNTHETIC TEST FIXTURE - NOT FOR DEPLOYMENT
# CrOniE invokes a shell that expands the bare wildcard in the controlled inbox as root.
# The helper is parser-only: option-like filenames select its fixed diagnostic.
* * * * * root cd /usr/share/iotbench/cronjob-wildcard-injection/inbox && /usr/share/iotbench/cronjob-wildcard-injection/bin/fixture-maintenance --fixture-test * >> /usr/share/iotbench/cronjob-wildcard-injection/logs/cron-vulnerable.jsonl 2>&1
